## 2026-01-01 09:15  #lifestyle #workout

Started the year feeling pretty good. Did a 30-minute yoga session this morning
and made a proper breakfast for once. Hoping to keep this momentum going into the
new year — setting a goal to run 3× a week and journal more consistently.

